ind":"announcement","title":"🎮 A Look at the Gameplay — IS THIS FEMBOY TAKEN?","summary":"We wanted to give you a closer look at how the gameplay is structured in IS THIS FEMBOY TAKEN? and show some of the key screens you’ll encounter. 🏆 Level Selection {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46307414/9d1352e3622af64dedd0cd63ba0a9b2e6f48c6d8.jpg The game is divided into 3 arcs, with 3 levels in each. Choose your next challenge and progress through the story. Please note: the arc names and some level icons are still being updated. 🎓 Tutorial {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46307414/0e4127bea4050c5c7f53d47e42d46c2c2c84","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T05:55:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928432","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:54:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5180060-1844751498217586","game_id":"steam-5180060","kind":"announcement","title":"IS THIS FEMBOY TAKEN⁉️ The Demo is Live! 😈","summary":"Every party has a secret ingredient… and it’s usually the guest list. Welcome to IS THIS FEMBOY TAKEN⁉️ a cheeky puzzle simulator where your job is to bring the right people together. Arrange your guests, discover interesting combinations, and solve the tricky situations hiding behind every invitation. Sometimes the perfect party needs careful planning… and sometimes a little bit of chaos makes things even better. 😉 The demo gives you the first look at the world, characters, and puzzles waiting ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T07:18:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217586","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:54:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5180060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:09:27Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10